		"",
		"A grader checks these names exactly:",
		"- Node name `acmeTasks`, display name \"Acme Tasks\".",
		"- Credential name `acmeTasksApi` with one field `apiKey` (a password field). The credential sends the key the way the docs say.",
		"- Operation `task.getAll` (\"Get many tasks\"). Fields: `status` (one of `any`, `open`, `done`; default `any`; `any` sends no status filter), `returnAll` (boolean, default false), `limit` (number, default 50; used when `returnAll` is false). Follow `nextCursor` to the last page, or until you have `limit` tasks. Do not fetch pages that you do not need. Emit one item per task: the task object exactly as the API returns it.",
		"- Operation `task.create` (\"Create a task\"). Fields: `title` (string, required), `assignee` (string, optional; send it only when it is not empty). Emit the created task object exactly as the API returns it.",
		"",
		"{{format}}",
		"",
		"Work in the current directory. Dependencies are installed: do not install packages. Do not ask questions.",
		"Stop when the node builds, passes the format checks, and works against the API."
